{
  "summary": "This experiment tested the scvi_n200 RNA encoder in the same RNA-only, singleprofile setup as config_001, achieving higher validation accuracy (0.52) and F1 (0.498) compared to config_001's 0.485 and 0.464. The results suggest RNA encoder selection may influence performance, but further experiments are needed to confirm. The role of image modality and alternative aggregation strategies remains uncertain without direct comparison."
}

